{"id": "33939", "title": "最佳老公(三朵花2)", "author": "艾佟", "category": "文学名著", "count": 50, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/33/33939.htm", "intro": "算命？这是骗人的玩意吧！这个扑克牌占卜居然说自己跟这男人的未来一片希望？她可是从小就为自己找好了“最佳老公”，还夸下海口会在明年的一月一日把自己嫁掉，而她想要钓的大鱼是好友温文儒雅的哥哥，不是这只“会一片希望”的大鲨鱼！而且这个想破坏她姻缘的男人真的很缠人，她毕旅去垦丁竟无时无刻不在“巧遇”，饭店是他家，游泳会撞到，连扭到脚他都刚好经过，还以为回到家就能跟他筑起分隔岛，谁知她跟“最佳老公”难得的晚餐约会他也来参一脚，还说她的梦中情人有断袖之癖！不会吧！他万般阻挠她是为了捍卫自己的爱情？难道他是“最佳老公”的秘密情人……", "base": "files/article/html/33/33939", "chapters": [{"title": "序言", "file": "2157831.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2157832.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2157833.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2157834.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2157835.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2157836.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2157837.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2157838.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2157839.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2157840.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2157841.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2157842.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2157843.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2157844.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2157845.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2157846.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2157847.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2157848.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2157849.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2157850.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2157851.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2157852.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2157853.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2157854.html", "available": f